{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7a041572d50ba989","name":"Jedi Knight Talent Trees","source":{"id":"source:reference-7a041572d50ba989","title":"Jedi Knight Talent Trees","revision":26665,"timestamp":"2025-05-28T19:10:55Z","sha256":"949ec376a56b2ed7456b793963cf58e6342e5a99a9dc6c4d5ab67e0850991184","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26665","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jedi%20Knight%20Talent%20Trees&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7a041572d50ba989","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At every odd-numbered level (1st, 3rd, 5th, and so on), a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Knight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Knight","referenceId":"reference:8a1e23d924066b37"}," gains an additional Jedi Knight Talent. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Knight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Knight","referenceId":"reference:8a1e23d924066b37"}," may choose a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," from any of the following Jedi Knight Talent Trees or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Talent Trees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Talent_Trees"}," they wish, but they must meet the prerequisites (if any) of the chosen Jedi Knight Talent. No ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," can be selected more than once unless expressly indicated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Specialist Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Specialist_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:e4e9b2aabaed45b7"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You can maximize the benefits of wearing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," while reducing or eliminating some of its drawbacks.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Duelist Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duelist_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:5c1f05597abfb6ef"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Through rigorous training and experience, you become one of the greatest swordfighters in the galaxy.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Combat Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Combat_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:11614943ef3f899e"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," is the chosen weapon of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},". Not as clumsy or random as a blaster, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," is an elegant weapon for a more civilized combatant. The following talents allow you to improve your prowess with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Forms Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Forms_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:d7f7f3ce518ae2f9"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You have refined your knowledge of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," technique, your blade becoming an extension of your self. Anyone using a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," may use one of these forms, but you have the discipline and patience to become a true master of the form.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Battlemaster Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Battlemaster_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:fa2916da9e2428a6"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Jedi Battlemasters are highly trained in Jedi combat techniques. They serve as the head combat trainers for Jedi organizations, and as Jedi commanders on the battlefield. Many Jedi Battlemasters begin their careers as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Guardians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Guardian_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:addde71bad5e6ba8"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Shadow Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Shadow_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:c5a718dc572b1952"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Jedi Shadows are often elite ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Sentinels"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Sentinel_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:39bae85f284ce360"}," who specialize in abilities that aid them in pursuing Dark Side users in all forms and locations. These Talents are also utilized by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Covenanters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Covenanters"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Watchman Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Watchman_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:7f408aabba5d0b2e"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Jedi Watchmen are elite Jedi tasked with protecting and watching over a specific world or region of space. They seek out and destroy threats to the Republic and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"},". As such, they have enhanced their abilities to blend in and covertly investigate threats at their source. All Jedi Watchmen are appointed and approved by the Jedi Council before training; many begin as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Consulars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Consular_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:2d5d4eaa526628c0"},". A Jedi Watchman's assignments might change, as directed by the council.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Archivist Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Archivist_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:294da77d16f7ed50"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You have dedicated your life as a Jedi to preserving knowledge and applying it in times when it is needed.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Healer Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Healer_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:e6fbd601c46acb29"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You have focused your natural ability with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to heal the sick and injured.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Refugee Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Refugee_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:8e1899f4d7572b45"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["In ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Legacy Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Legacy_Era"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," are once again hunted to near-extinction. To survive, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," must learn to conceal their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," and blend in with the common galactic citizen.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Artisan Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Artisan_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:b166daef92db5a47"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You have dedicated yourself to the art of creation, learning how to craft weapons and other items used by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," with exquisite detail.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Instructor Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Instructor_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:a17308c3f1e02dda"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The role of teacher is vital to the success and strength of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"},". Though all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Masters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Masters"}," take the time to instruct their apprentices, a certain few excel at the art of instruction.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Investigator Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Investigator_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:962dfe7da45c52eb"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You are one of The Jedi Order's most trusted investigators, tasked with ferreting out truth through a combination of detective work and Force divination.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Weapon Master Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Weapon_Master_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:efb3c085ba1093b7"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You have learned to use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to master a variety of weapons, and have expanded your martial prowess to cover more than just ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
